WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.107
Here are the numbers that summarize the impact.

00:00:03.187 --> 00:00:09.142
The models scale by one full order of magnitude in
both operations and feature resolution

00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:11.379
compared to prior spherical CNNs.

00:00:11.459 --> 00:00:18.770
They set state of the art on eight of twelve QM9
targets in the first split and nine of twelve in the second.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:23.720
The new JAX implementation is about three times
faster than the original,

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:29.619
and running distributed across thirty two TPUs
speeds it up by a hundred times or more.

00:00:29.699 --> 00:00:34.840
And the phase collapse nonlinearity alone reduces
QM9 error by eight percent.
